# Totentanz, Swarm Piper {1}{B}{R}, a 2/3: "Whenever Totentanz or another nontoken creature you control dies, create a 1/1 black Rat
# creature token with 'This token can't block.'" Bot1 plays Totentanz and a Memnite on turn one. On turn two Bot2's Black Lotus and
# three Lightning Bolts kill the Memnite (a nontoken creature: a Rat), then that Rat token (a token: nothing, CR 111.7) and then
# Totentanz itself (a Rat again), leaving one Rat token: black, 1/1, unable to block.

